{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1263200-chilling-adventures-of-sabrina-as-beast-chronicle","id":1263200,"title":"Chilling Adventures of Sabrina as Beast chronicle","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-10-28T08:38:36-07:00","id":1263200,"title":"Chilling Adventures of Sabrina as Beast chronicle","content":"Newest Netflix series, based on the comics of the same title - <i>Chilling Adventures of Sabrina</i> \u2013 has very much in common with <b>Beast: The Primordial </b>game, especially after <b>Beast Players Guide</b>. I will try to talk in generalities, but there would be some base spoilers from first episodes \u2013 so you are warned. For east of speaking on the shows universe I propose to short it to <b>CAoS</b> ( <i>Chilling Adventures of Sabrina</i> ). <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> If we looked in to base premise of <b>CAoS</b>, you will see clear analogies with <b>BtP</b>. To start, if we change show\u2019s Dark Lord name for the Dark Mother, Church of Night for the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1254421-fan-bpg-seekers-of-the-dark-mother-beast-societies-mechanics\">Empusae group</a> of the Begotten and magical spells for the Obcasus Rites \u2013 you can clearly see story of Spellman family as tale of local brood of Beasts in Greendale, being also literal family. If you see coming Dark Baptism for Sabrina as her proper Devouring, whole series becomes prelude to her future life as monster. The only thing would be that Sabrina before Dark Baptism would be some Minor Template, preparing only to be Beast \u2013 but she could clearly could be Psychic or Thaumaturge Template, they also are related to Dark Mother and her Children in the end. And whole visions and intertwined events in proper series makes great story hooks for your coming to be Devoured characters. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <b>Side note:</b> I really now think about making Church of Night as multiple monster races organisation for the game, where Beasts would be priests to Dark Mother mixed with Circle of Crone, Lancea Sanctum, Mysterium and Autumn Courts members in it. Just cool idea I got from Netflix series and <b>CoD</b> universe here. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 10-28-2018, 11:46 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-28T08:44:23-07:00","id":1263202,"title":"","content":"Familiars in <b>CAoS</b> ( <i>Chilling Adventures of Sabrina</i> ) looks like special, animalistic Manifestation for Ephemeral Entity, bound with the caster. More limited and open at the same time in <b>Mage</b> 2E.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-20T01:01:03-08:00","id":1362069,"title":"","content":"Season 2 Spoiler - At the end of Season 2, Sabrina looks much more like Lucifuge member, with her literally defying Lucifer, but using his magic. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-11T00:15:08-08:00","id":1366921,"title":"","content":"In season 3 we have full <b>BtP</b> analogy when Greendale coven start to worship Lilith and Hecate, both official interpretations of Dark Mother by Begotten. \ud83d\ude0e","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 12-31-2020, 05:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-12-31T14:27:34-08:00","id":1430613,"title":"","content":"In season 4 coven goes full on Hecate worship as literal Dark Mother mentioned in the series. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Also, they worship Goddess as Maiden, Mother and Crone, so Circle of the Crone vampires would be at home in this Begotten groups. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#B22222\">Edit:<br /> <br /> Sadly this thread doesn't seem to have gotten much engagement. Closed.</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 12-31-2020, 09:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}